LUTAR-1#1 Warning
LUT drives async reset alert
LUT cell core_reset_meta_i_1, with 2 or more inputs, drives asynchronous preset/clear pin(s) core_reset_meta_reg/CLR, core_reset_n_reg/CLR. The LUT may glitch and trigger an unexpected reset, even if it is a properly timed path.
Related violations: <none>

